      "Mixture of 2 Gaussians\n",
      "Weights: [0.541776 0.458224]\n",
      "Means: [ 0.00786478 -0.00599689]\n",
      "Standard deviations: [0.02775083 0.02780312]\n",
      "\n",
      "Mixture of 3 Gaussians\n",
      "Weights: [0.17718456 0.1705179  0.65229754]\n",
